#### Filter Syntax Basics

**OR** (Outputs the union of both runs):
```text
[run1] [run2]
```

**AND** (run2 uses the output of run1):
```text
[run1] +[run2]
```

**NOT** (run2 strikes output from run1):
```text
[run1] -[run2]
```

**Negates the operator** 
```text
[!operator[parameter]]
```

**Exact string match**:
```text
[=operator[parameter]]
```
---
---
#### Common Operators

**Has specific tag** (`tag`):
```text
[tag[Journal]]
```

**Matches field value** (`field:X`):
```text
[field:status[done]]
```

**Has the specified field** (`has`):
```text
[has[draft.of]]
```

**Search specific fields & flags**:
```text
[search:title,text[keyword]]
```
```text
[search:text:regexp[keyword]]
```

---
---

**Sort alpha (`(A-Z) / (Z-A)`)**:
```text
[!sort:casesensitive[title]]
```

**Sort numeric (`(0-9) / (9-0)`)** :
```text
[!nsort[priority]]
```

**Return first N results** (`limit`):
```text
[limit[10]]
```

**Select standard domains** (`all`):
```text
[all[tiddlers]]
```

---
---
**Match tiddler categories** (`is`):
```text
[is[system]]
```
```text
[is[shadow]]
```

**Extract field value** (`get`):
```text
[get[text]]
```

---

#### Variables & Transclusions

**Transclusion** (Filter on field's contents):
```text
[tag[{!!parent}]]
```

**Variables** (Filter on variable's contents):
```text
[tag<currentTiddler>]
```
